  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h2><strong>About Our Brand &amp; Products</strong></h2><p>Icon Shears is a professional cutting tool brand built for <strong>stylists, barbers, educators, and serious students</strong>. Our shears are designed for precision, comfort, and daily professional use in salons, barbershops, and classrooms. We focus on performance, ergonomics, and real-world reliability — not gimmicks.</p><hr><h2><strong>What Makes Us Different</strong></h2><p>We are <strong>education-first and professional-driven</strong>. Icon Shears partners with working stylists, barbers, and educators, prioritizes long-term relationships, and protects the value of our tools. We believe in craftsmanship, credibility, and community.</p><hr><h2><strong>How Affiliates Can Earn</strong></h2><p>Affiliates earn commissions on qualifying sales made through approved referral links or codes.</p><ul><li><p>Transparent tracking</p></li><li><p>No inventory required</p></li><li><p>Promote tools you genuinely use and trust</p></li></ul><hr><h2><strong>How to Promote Us</strong></h2><p>Affiliates may promote Icon Shears through:</p><ul><li><p>Salon or barbershop recommendations</p></li><li><p>Classroom demonstrations</p></li><li><p>Social media content</p></li><li><p>Educational videos or posts</p></li></ul><p>Affiliates must represent the brand professionally and comply with FTC disclosure guidelines.</p><hr><h2><strong>Other Information</strong></h2><p>Affiliate approval is required. Icon Shears reserves the right to remove affiliates who do not align with brand standards. Program terms, commissions, and payout details are provided upon approval.</p><hr><h1><br></h1></div>",
